Merges your halves back into you, cleansing your body of [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] detrimental magical, mental or physical effects.

Each half also heals you for [106, 137, 160, 180, 197 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] and releases a shockwave dealing [106, 137, 161, 180, 197 (TL1-5; WIL 100)] Nature damage in a radius 3.
